Halligan is a fork of Ax. Most of this repository is Ax code carried downstream
and periodically resynchronized with upstream. Halligan's own additions live in
src/ax/trajectory, src/ax/mind, src/ax/learn, the evidence and authority guards
documented under docs/, the maintainer skills under tools/*/skills, and the
playground under playground/.

